e map\n<MATH_0015>. Write <MATH_0016>\nas the filtered colimit of its finite type quasi-coherent submodules\n(Lemma <REF_0004>). Then\n<MATH_0017> is a solution\nto the problem posed by the lemma.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0db83f97250a28646cd562592bd6a493d2288f7a4eb8c8f35fff754695a0f0f0", "unit_id": "tag:086M:proof"}
